{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3aab0e91f7ada4dfe6f7f2cb727fe9f2.avif?t=1761831630\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/77c1b774f6ad54cce38241c7246ac7fe.poster.avif?t=1761831630\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/77c1b774f6ad54cce38241c7246ac7fe.webm?t=1761831630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/83f9e0384dff57301838a0589da8b146.avif?t=1761831630\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/30ff6640191009a4c51f41606c5c65d2.poster.avif?t=1761831630\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/30ff6640191009a4c51f41606c5c65d2.